    "## 4. 工作原理 {#how-it-works}\n",
    "\n",
    "### 内存工具架构\n",
    "\n",
    "内存工具是**客户端**的——你控制存储。Claude 进行工具调用，你的应用程序执行它们。\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 内存工具命令\n",
    "\n",
    "| 命令 | 描述 | 示例 |\n",
    "|---------|-------------|----------|\n",
    "| `view` | 显示目录或文件内容 | `{\"command\": \"view\", \"path\": \"/memories\"}` |\n",
    "| `create` | 创建或覆盖文件 | `{\"command\": \"create\", \"path\": \"/memories/notes.md\", \"file_text\": \"...\"}` |\n",
    "| `str_replace` | 替换文件中的文本 | `{\"command\": \"str_replace\", \"path\": \"...\", \"old_str\": \"...\", \"new_str\": \"...\"}` |\n",
    "| `insert` | 在指定行号插入文本 | `{\"command\": \"insert\", \"path\": \"...\", \"insert_line\": 2, \"insert_text\": \"...\"}` |\n",
    "| `delete` | 删除文件或目录 | `{\"command\": \"delete\", \"path\": \"/memories/old.txt\"}` |\n",
    "| `rename` | 重命名或移动文件 | `{\"command\": \"rename\", \"old_path\": \"...\", \"new_path\": \"...\"}` |\n",
    "\n",
    "有关完整实现（包括路径验证和安全措施），请参阅 `memory_tool.py`。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 思考管理（`clear_thinking_20251015`）\n",
    "\n",
    "使用扩展思考时，思考块会累积并消耗 token。`clear_thinking` 策略会自动管理这些内容。\n",
    "\n",
    "**重要**：此策略需要在 API 调用中启用 `thinking`。\n",
    "\n",
    "**API 调用模式**（启用扩展思考）：\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "response = client.beta.messages.create(\n",
    "    betas=[\"context-management-2025-06-27\"],  # 必需的 beta 标志\n",
    "    model=\"claude-sonnet-4-6\",\n",
    "    messages=messages,\n",
    "    tools=[{\"type\": \"memory_20250818\", \"name\": \"memory\"}],\n",
    "    thinking={\"type\": \"enabled\", \"budget_tokens\": 10000},  # 启用思考\n",
    "    context_management={  # 上下文编辑配置\n",
    "        \"edits\": [\n",
    "            {\n",
    "                \"type\": \"clear_thinking_20251015\",\n",
    "                \"keep\": {\"type\": \"thinking_turns\", \"value\": 1}  # 只保留最后一轮\n",
    "            },\n",
    "            {\n",
    "                \"type\": \"clear_tool_uses_20250919\",\n",
    "                \"trigger\": {\"type\": \"input_tokens\", \"value\": 35000},\n",
    "                \"keep\": {\"type\": \"tool_uses\", \"value\": 5}\n",
    "            }\n",
    "        ]\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    max_tokens=2048\n",
    ")\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**关键点：**\n",
    "- 组合策略时，`clear_thinking` 必须**放在第一位**\n",
    "- 需要启用扩展思考（`thinking={\"type\": \"enabled\", ...}`）\n",
    "- 使用 `\"keep\": \"all\"` 保留所有思考块以获得最大缓存命中率\n",
    "- 思考的触发器是可选的（根据 `keep` 值清理）"
